    title: "How to Hide Videos on Your Phone Without Leaving a Trace",
    description: "Videos are harder to hide than photos \u2014 they leave bigger footprints. Here's how to truly conceal sensitive videos on iOS and Android, from thumbnails to cloud leaks.",
    category: "Privacy Guides",
    author: "Lena Hart",
    authorRole: "Privacy Editor",
