    title: "How to Hide Photos From Your Gallery Without Deleting Them",
    description: "You don't have to erase memories to keep them private. Here's how to remove photos from your phone's gallery while keeping them safe, accessible, and encrypted.",
    category: "Privacy Guides",
    author: "Marco Reyes",
